dit.",[23,1221,1223],{"id":1222},"what-you-can-change","What you can change",[28,1225,1226,1229,1232,1235],{},[31,1227,1228],{},"Primary and accent colors, backgrounds, button colors, tab colors",[31,1230,1231],{},"Button and tab font family and size",[31,1233,1234],{},"Button width, radius, border width, gaps, and padding",[31,1236,1237],{},"GIF overlay opacity (normal and hover)",[23,1239,1241],{"id":1240},"save-and-share","Save and share",[28,1243,1244,1250,1256,1262],{},[31,1245,1246,1249],{},[18,1247,1248],{},"Export .css"," — write a theme file you can back up or send to a friend",[31,1251,1252,1255],{},[18,1253,1254],{},"Add to Themes"," — save the file into your Themes folder and apply it",[31,1257,1258,1261],{},[18,1259,1260],{},"Import .css"," — load a built-in preset or a saved theme",[31,1263,1264,1267],{},[18,1265,1266],{},"Reset"," — return to SoundNinja defaults",[14,1269,1270],{},"If you close the window with unsaved changes, SoundNinja asks you to save first.",[23,1272,1274],{"id":1273},"without-the-full-editor","Without the full editor",[14,1276,1277,1278,1280],{},"In ",[18,1279,61],{}," you can still:",[28,1282,1283,1286,1292],{},[31,1284,1285],{},"Pick a theme from the list",[31,1287,1288,1289,1205],{},"Edit CSS variables live (",[18,1290,1291],{},"Custom CSS",[31,1293,1294],{},"Import a theme file into the Themes folder",{"title":402,"searchDepth":403,"depth":403,"links":1296},[1297,1298,1299,1300],{"id":1188,"depth":403,"text":1189},{"id":1222,"depth":403,"text":1223},{"id":1240,"depth":403,"text":1241},{"id":1273,"depth":403,"text":1274},"Design colors, fonts, buttons, and tabs in the Theme Creator.",{},5,"\u002Ftheme-editor",{"title":1174,"description":1301},"zpMjxENa49aUipEX7TBxcqrbaZNweyJ019KsLAMJeoc",{"id":1308,"title":1309,"body":1310,"description":1447,"extension":420,"meta":1448,"navigation":422,"order":1449,"path":1450,"seo":1451,"stem":1314,"__hash__":1452},"content_en\u002Frecording-editor.md","Recording Editor",{"type":7,"value":1311,"toc":1441},[1312,1315,1321,1325,1331,1351,1354,1358,1383,1387,1402,1406,1420,1431],[10,1313,1309],{"id":1314},"recording-editor",[14,1316,1317,1318,1320],{},"Record a clip inside SoundNinja, trim it, then import it onto a tab. Open the editor with the ",[18,1319,859],{}," button in the player bar.",[23,1322,1324],{"id":1323},"choose-an-input","Choose an input",[14,1326,1277,1327,1330],{},[18,1328,1329],{},"Settings → Audio",":",[28,1332,1333,1339,1345],{},[31,1334,1335,1338],{},[18,1336,1337],{},"Input Devices"," — microphone",[31,1340,1341,1344],{},[18,1342,1343],{},"Output Devices (PC Audio)"," — loopback of what your PC is playing",[31,1346,1347,1350],{},[18,1348,1349],{},"Input volume"," — capture gain from 0% to 200%",[14,1352,1353],{},"The Record button uses the device you pick here.",[23,1355,1357],{"id":1356},"edit-the-take","Edit the take",[28,1359,1360,1363,1366,1374,1377,1380],{},[31,1361,1362],{},"Record and stop",[31,1364,1365],{},"Watch the input level meter",[31,1367,1368,587,1371],{},[18,1369,1370],{},"Normalize",[18,1372,1373],{},"Noise Cancelation",[31,1375,1376],{},"Trim the whole clip, trim to a selection, or delete a selection",[31,1378,1379],{},"Undo \u002F redo",[31,1381,1382],{},"Zoom in and out",[23,1384,1386],{"id":1385},"stage-and-import","Stage and import",[118,1388,1389,1392,1395],{},[31,1390,1391],{},"Add the selection or the full track to the staging list.",[31,1393,1394],{},"The list starts empty: record, edit, then add a clip.",[31,1396,1397,587,1399,1401],{},[18,1398,863],{},[18,1400,866],{}," into the current tab or a tab you choose.",[23,1403,1405],{"id":1404},"stem-separation-optional","Stem separation (optional)",[14,1407,1408,1409,1412,1413,587,1416,1419],{},"Official Windows, macOS, and Linux release builds ship the ",[18,1410,1411],{},"stems"," feature. The Record Editor can keep ",[18,1414,1415],{},"vocals",[18,1417,1418],{},"music"," using BS-RoFormer.",[14,1421,1422,1423,1426,1427,1430],{},"The model is about 158 MB and is ",[18,1424,1425],{},"not"," bundled with the installer. Download it from ",[18,1428,1429],{},"Settings → Stem Separation",", or accept the first-run prompt. The Windows installer can also offer to download the model on first launch.",[14,1432,1433,1434,1201,1437,1440],{},"Custom source builds need an extra flag (",[647,1435,1436],{},"tauri:serve:stems",[647,1438,1439],{},"tauri:build:stems",").",{"title":402,"searchDepth":403,"depth":403,"links":1442},[1443,1444,1445,1446],{"id":1323,"depth":403,"text":1324},{"id":1356,"depth":403,"text":1357},{"id":1385,"depth":403,"text":1386},{"id":1404,"depth":403,"text":1405},"Capture mic or PC audio, edit the clip, and drop it on your board.",{},6,"\u002Frecording-editor",{"title":1309,"description":1447},"WLz7ozLeboeLKawRkz53eUj5KSVCj4xkPMhYg5P_MIo",{"id":1454,"title":1455,"body":1456,"description":1669,"extension":420,"meta":1670,"navigation":422,"order":1671,"path":1672,"seo":1673,"stem":1460,"__hash__":1674},"content_en\u002Fremote-control.md","Remote Control",{"type":7,"value":1457,"toc":1662},[1458,1461,1464,1468,1497,1500,1503,1538,1542,1562,1565,1569,1601,1605,1611],[10,1459,1455],{"id":1460},"remote-control",[14,1462,1463],{},"SoundNinja can listen on your local network so Bitfocus Companion (or any HTTP\u002FWebSocket client) can play and stop sounds.",[23,1465,1467],{"id":1466},"enable-the-remote-server","Enable the remote server",[118,1469,1470,1475,1481,1487],{},[31,1471,122,1472,97],{},[18,1473,1474],{},"Settings → Remote",[31,1476,1477,1478,97],{},"Enable the remote server. Default port is ",[18,1479,1480],{},"7331",[31,1482,1483,1484,97],{},"Optional: set a token. Clients must send it as a Bearer token or ",[647,1485,1486],{},"?token=",[31,1488,1489,1490,1493,1494,97],{},"Copy the ",[647,1491,1492],{},"http:\u002F\u002FIP:PORT"," URL, or copy the system IP from ",[18,1495,1496],{},"Settings → About",[14,1498,1499],{},"Windows may show a firewall prompt the first time the server starts. Allow private-network